# No exclusions.
#
# This repository tracks EVERYTHING in the workspace at the owner's explicit
# request: source, data, logs, the virtualenv (.venv/), bytecode caches
# (__pycache__/) and any secrets-override files (.env, cookies.json,
# secrets.json, config.local.yaml) if they ever appear.
#
# Consequence to be aware of: any file created with one of those names will now
# be committed and pushed automatically. Treat .env / cookies.json as public
# from the moment they exist.
#
# To restore conventional ignores later, re-add rules such as:
#   .venv/
#   __pycache__/
#   .env
#   cookies.json
